 > 
 > Any clues on how to solve this??
 > 

Check your cabling & termination.   What does SRM 'show dev' or 'show
conf' have to say about your drives?  Does it see them?  What happens
if you try to boot from something in that array (eg to get SRM to
read the bootblock area of the disk & tell you its not a valid bootblock)

